@startuml
left to right direction

[*] --> GuestMode
GuestMode : Passive Access\n(Search & View Map)

GuestMode --> EnteringCredentials : User taps\nLogin
GuestMode --> Registering : User taps\nSign Up

state EnteringCredentials {
  EnteringCredentials : User inputs\nemail & password
}

EnteringCredentials --> Authenticating : Submit Data
Authenticating : Validating credentials\nwith Server

Authenticating --> EnteringCredentials : Login Failed\n(Wrong Password)
Authenticating --> AuthenticatedSession : Login Success

Registering : Input personal details\n& Privacy Consent
Registering --> AuthenticatedSession : Registration\nComplete

state AuthenticatedSession {
  AuthenticatedSession : Full Access\n(Tracking, Reporting,\nHistory Management)
}

AuthenticatedSession --> GuestMode : User Logouts
AuthenticatedSession --> GuestMode : Session Expired\n(Timeout)

@enduml